# TypeAssert with default that itself errors
# The default is evaluated when type mismatch occurs, and if the default
# errors, that error propagates (not masked by type assertion failure)
[@[type: Int  default: [raise "deliberate error"]] "hello"]
=== error
[E080] deliberate error (defined at stdlib/prelude.llt:2428:28-2428:47)
  --> stdlib/prelude.llt:2428:28-2428:47
   |
  2428 | """]: [fn [let msg@String] [builtin-raise msg]]
       |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  in [builtin-raise ...] at stdlib/prelude.llt:2428:28-2428:47
   |
  2428 | """]: [fn [let msg@String] [builtin-raise msg]]
       |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
